mapping "V1500.1" source="V1500" target="48084008" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V1500 = Swedish extension of V15.0 SNOMED CT 213770003 47397001 48084008 + activity
        (sport/exercise). The activity suffix is a Swedish national detail with no SNOMED CT analogue.
        Targets inherit the verified Athena crosswalk of base V15.0 (concept 45756215): 432510
        (48084008), 433099 (47397001), 440896 (213770003). Each target is broader: it subsumes the
        source minus the activity dimension. per rubric: verified crosswalk with one-level breadth
        mismatch (Swedish activity extension).
        """
}
